    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;</i><strong>STELLAR INC</strong><i>&quot; </i>is an <strong>adult kinetic novel</strong>. It contain erotic and pornographic elements. <strong>Player discretion is advised.</strong><br><br><br>You will be playing as <strong>Jaden Brown</strong>, a young and successful businessman, meeting and training a new intern for your startup company.<strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655720/extras/2c9f9a4c21edd21ad89d5f4e1c90ff98.avif?t=1746101977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong></strong><br>The new intern is <strong>Chloe Nguyen</strong>, graduate as a valedictorian from a good business school in the country. She landed a job in your company, and has been working as your assistant for a couple of weeks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655720/extras/76ac2809b40fbb0213caf1ab87994edd.avif?t=1746101977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>There's a chemistry between you and <strong>Chloe,</strong> but for the reaction to happen, you need to be at the right place at the right time...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655720/extras/93e8b960fbbc01210a82164fe8363ddd.avif?t=1746101977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
